{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關在全港搗破四個私煙儲存倉庫，共檢獲約425萬支私煙，應課稅值逾1,400萬元，4人被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關展示檢獲的私煙，估計市值約2,000萬元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CIGARETTE-0130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qqtX7V531n1788300722.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CIGARETTE-0130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關指，昨日中午先在新田一間鐵皮倉庫，檢獲一批私煙及大批私煙傳單。下午再在荃灣沙咀道一棟工業大廈，分別在兩個單位檢獲私煙。晚上在北角一個店舖，搜獲第四批私煙。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CIGARETTE-0130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026WBIK6S92Wo1788300719.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CIGARETTE-0130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關行動中共拘捕4名涉案男子，年齡介乎27至52歲，全部報稱無業，被帶返海關總部作進一步調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T22:20:37.614862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}